OL,3,AIsraeli strikes in southern Lebanese
OL,4,Avillage kill nine
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli air strikes on a village in
OL,7,Fsouthern Lebanon have killed at least
OL,8,Fnine people, the Lebanese health
OL,9,Fministry says.
OL,11,FEight people, including a child and two
OL,12,Fwomen, were killed in one strike that
OL,13,Fdestroyed a residential building in
OL,14,FKfar Remman overnight, according to the
OL,15,Fministry. A second strike on a vehicle
OL,16,Fkilled a paramedic.
OL,18,FThe Israeli military said it was
OL,19,Flooking into the reports.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
